// The FRAME — where the lens is composited with WebGL. The one surface this shape has:
// an arrangement can be left undrawn, but a picture nothing composites is not shown at all.
//
// `floating` is the only layout it draws in: a window over whichever page is on screen,
// moved by its title bar and sized by its corner. `ui viewport` shows or hides it.
type("viewport")
layout("floating")
